---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | MyRigFoundry"
  description="Learn how MyRigFoundry handles information, external services, cookies and privacy."
>
  <section class="info-page">
    <div class="info-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY POLICY</p>

      <h1>Privacy Policy.</h1>

      <p class="info-lead">
        This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected,
        used and handled when you visit MyRigFoundry.
      </p>

      <div class="info-content">
        <h2>Information you provide</h2>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry may receive information that you choose to provide
          directly, such as when you contact us by email.
        </p>

        <p>
          This may include your email address, message content and any
          information you voluntarily include in your communication.
        </p>

        <h2>Website usage information</h2>

        <p>
          Like most websites, MyRigFoundry may use hosting, analytics or
          security services that process technical information about visits
          to the website.
        </p>

        <p>
          This information may include details such as browser type,
          device type, operating system, pages visited, approximate location,
          referring pages and other technical data used to operate and
          understand the website.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry may use cookies or similar technologies when they are
          required for website functionality, analytics, advertising or other
          services used by the website.
        </p>

        <p>
          The specific technologies used may change as the website develops.
          This policy will be updated when additional services are introduced.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry may display advertising in the future through
          third-party advertising providers.
        </p>

        <p>
          Advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies in
          accordance with their own privacy policies and applicable legal
          requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate links</h2>

        <p>
          Some pages may contain affiliate links to third-party websites.
          If you follow one of these links, the destination website may
          collect information according to its own privacy practices.
        </p>

        <p>
          More information about affiliate relationships is available in our
          <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/"> Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>External websites</h2>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry may link to manufacturers, software providers,
          retailers, documentation and other external websites.
        </p>

        <p>
          MyRigFoundry is not responsible for the privacy practices of
          third-party websites. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies
          when visiting them.
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>

        <p>
          Information provided directly to MyRigFoundry may be retained only
          for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it
          was received, including responding to inquiries, maintaining
          records and protecting the website.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy may be updated when MyRigFoundry introduces new
          services, analytics tools, advertising systems or other features
          that affect how information is processed.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
          Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent through our
          <a href="/contact/"> Contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>